@host = http://localhost:5151

GET {{host}}/health

### Register a tenant (Owner)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organisationName": "Example Civils Ltd",
  "fullName": "Alex Example",
  "email": "alex@examplecivils.test",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### Login demo tenant
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@demo.subclear.uk",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Billing entitlements
GET {{host}}/api/billing/entitlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout (Owner / Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/billing/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Customer portal (Owner / Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/billing/portal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
